      "value": "Exactly theres nothing to wear on vrchat anymore but what i hate the most about it is that vrchat always find away to sexuallize chibi's avatars such as fooshis, mankuas or genuine cute smaller avis made by teally talented people and vrchat takes them down for \"copy right\" or \"being sexualized\" it gets to a point.",
